<header class="hero"><div class="hero-card"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="kicker">Fictional hotel | family friendly</span><h1>Fishlin Hotel Line</h1><p><strong>Comfortable stays. Attentive service.</strong> Enjoy ocean views, family activities, peaceful rooms, and a little moonlight magic in this hotel experience.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn primary" href="#booking">Book a Room</a><a class="btn light" href="#activities">Explore the Hotel</a></div></div></div></header>
<section class="section" id="rooms">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Rooms and Suites</h2><p class="lead">Comfortable stays with practical amenities and coastal design.</p></div></div>
<div class="suite-tabs" role="tablist">
