</div>
<div id="rooms-panel" class="suite-panel active"><div class="grid rooms">
<article class="card photo-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551882547-ff40c63fe5fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Comfortable hotel room"><div class="photo-credit">Photography via Unsplash</div><div class="room-info"><h3>Coastal King Room</h3><p class="small">King bed, work desk, walk-in shower, Wi-Fi, climate control, and city or garden views.</p><div class="price">$180 / night</div><button class="btn ghost" onclick="chooseRoom(180)">Select room</button></div></article>
<article class="card photo-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1723516908282-b3c795e9416a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Luxury hotel lobby interior"><div class="photo-credit">Photography via Unsplash</div><div class="room-info"><h3>Ocean View King</h3><p class="small">Floor-to-ceiling windows, king bed, lounge chair, upgraded bath amenities, and ocean-facing views.</p><div class="price">$325 / night</div><button class="btn ghost" onclick="chooseRoom(325)">Select room</button></div></article>
<article class="card photo-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540518614846-7eded433c457?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Hotel room with two beds"><div class="photo-credit">Photography via Unsplash</div><div class="room-info"><h3>Deluxe Double Room</h3><p class="small">Two beds, larger seating area, spacious bath, and flexible sleeping arrangements.</p><div class="price">$275 / night</div><button class="btn ghost" onclick="chooseRoom(275)">Select room</button></div></article>
</div></div>
<div id="suites-panel" class="suite-panel"><div class="grid rooms">
<article class="card photo-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590490360182-c33d57733427?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Premium hotel suite"><div class="photo-credit">Photography via Unsplash</div><div class="room-info"><h3>Fishlin Suite</h3><p class="small">Separate living area, king bedroom, dining table, premium bath, and private balcony.</p><div class="price">$650 / night</div><button class="btn ghost" onclick="chooseRoom(650)">Select suite</button></div></article>
<article class="card photo-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Boutique hotel suite interior"><div class="photo-credit">Photography via Unsplash</div><div class="room-info"><h3>Executive Bay Suite</h3><p class="small">Large living room, premium workspace, upgraded minibar, and panoramic bay views.</p><div class="price">$900 / night</div><button class="btn ghost" onclick="chooseRoom(900)">Select suite</button></div></article>
</div></div>
