</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="amenities"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Hotel Amenities</h2><p class="lead">Spaces designed for relaxing, working, dining, and family time.</p></div></div><div class="grid gallery" style="margin-bottom:20px"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648706319922-5b884abb264d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=82" alt="Hotel pool at dusk"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1723516908282-b3c795e9416a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=82" alt="Hotel lobby"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1759038086832-795644825e3a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=82" alt="Hotel reception"></div><div class="grid amenities"><div class="icon-card"><h3>Indoor and Outdoor Pools</h3><p class="small">Seasonal outdoor pool, heated indoor pool, loungers, and cabana service.</p></div><div class="icon-card"><h3>Fitness Center</h3><p class="small">Cardio equipment, resistance machines, free weights, and stretching area.</p></div><div class="icon-card"><h3>Quiet Library</h3><p class="small">A low-noise lounge with reading chairs, desks, and complimentary Wi-Fi.</p></div><div class="icon-card"><h3>Family Game Lounge</h3><p class="small">Board games, puzzles, and a supervised family activity schedule.</p></div><div class="icon-card"><h3>Garden</h3><p class="small">Landscaped outdoor space with seating and evening lighting.</p></div><div class="icon-card"><h3>Front Desk</h3><p class="small">Front desk support available 24 hours a day.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="dining"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Dining</h2><p class="lead">Fictional menus for your hotel roleplay.</p></div></div><div class="breakfast-box" style="margin-bottom:20px"><h3>Breakfast Service</h3><div class="service-hours"><div><strong>Monday to Friday</strong><br>6:30 AM to 10:30 AM</div><div><strong>Saturday and Sunday</strong><br>6:30 AM to 11:00 AM</div></div><p class="small" style="margin-bottom:0">Breakfast is served in The Blue Tide. In-room breakfast is available by advance request.</p></div><div class="grid food"><article class="card"><h3> The Blue Tide</h3><p class="small">Seafood, burgers, pasta, salads, and family meals.</p><div class="price">$25–$85</div></article><article class="card"><h3>☕ Moonbeam Café</h3><p class="small">Coffee, cocoa, pastries, sandwiches, and quick snacks.</p><div class="price">$6–$30</div></article><article class="card"><h3> Sunset Scoops</h3><p class="small">Ice cream, milkshakes, fruit cups, and sweet treats.</p><div class="price">$5–$25</div></article><article class="card"><h3> Starry Rooftop</h3><p class="small">A  premium dinner setting with city-and-bay views.</p><div class="price">$75–$200</div></article></div></section>
<section class="section" id="activities"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Things To Do</h2><p class="lead">Make your stay feel like a mini adventure.</p></div></div><div class="grid activity-grid"><article class="card activity"><div class="activity-content"><h3>️ Beach Day</h3><p>Build a sandcastle, relax by the water, or explore the shore.</p></div></article><article class="card activity"><div class="activity-content"><h3>️ City Explorer</h3><p>Take a  self-guided city tour around Fishlin Hotel Line.</p></div></article><article class="card activity"><div class="activity-content"><h3> Craft Club</h3><p>Family-friendly crafts, decorations, and creative projects.</p></div></article><article class="card activity"><div class="activity-content"><h3> Movie Night</h3><p>Cozy movie nights with snacks and a family lounge.</p></div></article></div></section>
