</div></div><div class="card total-box"><h3>Your Stay</h3><div id="summary"></div><div class="total">Total: <span id="total">$0</span></div><p class="small" style="color:#c9dce8">Fictional calculator only. No real payment or reservation is processed.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="info-strip"><div class="card"><div class="icon">⭐</div><h3>Fishlin Rewards</h3><p class="small">Earn points from real site activities and completed stays.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">‍‍‍</div><h3>Family Friendly</h3><p class="small">Bookings support adults and children for family roleplay.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon"></div><h3>Dreamy Extras</h3><p class="small">Add breakfast, cabanas, activities, parking, and more.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="rewards"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Fishlin Rewards Rewards</h2><p class="lead">Points come from activities and stays — not random button clicks.</p></div></div><div class="grid rooms"><article class="card"><h3>How to earn</h3><p class="small">Book a stay +100 | Complete a stay +300 | Book 30+ days early +100 | Book a suite +250 | Write a stay review +75 | Birthday stay +500</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Levels</h3><p class="small">Starlight: 0–999 | Moon: 1,000–4,999 | Lunar: 5,000–9,999 | Galaxy: 10,000+</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Rewards</h3><p class="small">500: $10 hotel credit | 2,500: free breakfast | 5,000: room upgrade | 10,000: free  weekend stay</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section" id="reviews"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Guest Reviews</h2><p class="lead">Recent guest feedback displayed on the hotel website.</p></div><div><div class="review-score">4.7 / 5</div><div class="review-meta">Based on 1,284 verified stays</div></div></div><div class="grid review-grid"><article class="review-card"><h3>Elena R.</h3><div class="review-meta">Stayed in the Ocean View King</div><p>The room was quiet, the view was excellent, and breakfast service was easy to use. The front desk team was especially helpful.</p><strong>5.0 / 5</strong></article><article class="review-card"><h3>Marcus T.</h3><div class="review-meta">Stayed in the Family Room</div><p>The family layout worked very well for us. The pool area and activity lounge gave everyone something to do between outings.</p><strong>4.8 / 5</strong></article><article class="review-card"><h3>Priya S.</h3><div class="review-meta">Stayed in the Fishlin Suite</div><p>Beautiful suite, comfortable bed, and a spacious living area. Check-in was quick and the property felt very well maintained.</p><strong>4.9 / 5</strong></article></div></section><section class="section" id="faq"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>FAQ</h2><p class="lead">Answers for the hotel experience.</p></div></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is Fishlin Hotel Line real?</summary><p class="small">No. Fishlin Hotel Line is a website and roleplay experience.</p></details><details><summary>Can families stay here?</summary><p class="small">Yes. The  booking form supports adults and children.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change my profile?</summary><p class="small">Yes. Your display name, bio, profile picture, and hotel role can be changed at any time.</p></details><details><summary>Do reservations process real payments?</summary><p class="small">No. The reservation calculator does not process real payments.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use a real Google account?</summary><p class="small">A real sign-in system requires Firebase Authentication or another secure authentication backend. This HTML file includes a safe placeholder instead of pretending login is connected.</p></details></div></section>
<section class="section" id="assistant"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Moonlight FAQ Assistant</h2><p class="lead">This assistant answers Fishlin Hotel Line FAQ questions only.</p></div></div><div class="chatbox"><div class="chat-log" id="chatLog"><div class="msg bot">Hi! Ask me a Fishlin Hotel Line FAQ question, such as “Is the hotel real?”</div></div><div class="chat-input"><input id="chatInput" placeholder="Ask a hotel FAQ question..."><button class="btn primary" id="chatSend" onclick="askAssistant()">Send</button></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="account"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Guest Account</h2><p class="lead">Customize your hotel profile.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="notice">For real account authentication, connect this page to Firebase Authentication (Google sign-in) or another secure backend. The editable profile below saves locally in this browser.</div><div style="height:14px"></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="displayName">Display name</label><input id="displayName" placeholder="Guest"></div><div class="field"><label for="hotelRole">Hotel role</label><select id="hotelRole"><option>Guest</option><option>Hotel Staff</option><option>Manager</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="bio">Bio</label><textarea id="bio" rows="3" placeholder="A short bio..."></textarea></div><div class="field full"><label for="avatarUrl">Profile picture URL</label><input id="avatarUrl" placeholder="https://..."></div></div><div class="account-actions" style="margin-top:14px"><button class="btn primary" onclick="saveProfile()">Save Profile</button><button class="btn ghost" onclick="demoGoogleSignIn()">Sign in with Google (setup required)</button><button class="btn ghost" onclick="loadProfile()">Reload Profile</button></div><div class="profile-preview"><div class="avatar" id="avatarPreview">G</div><div><strong id="profileName">Guest</strong><div class="small" id="profileRole">Guest</div><div class="small" id="profileBio">Your hotel profile.</div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="experience"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Virtual Hotel Experience</h2><p class="lead">After booking, enter the hotel for a small interactive scene.</p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="experience-scene"><div class="hotel-building"><div class="hotel-roof"></div><div class="hotel-sign"> MOONLIGHT BAY</div><div class="windows"><div class="window"></div><div class="window"></div><div class="window"></div><div class="window"></div><div class="window"></div><div class="window"></div></div><div class="floor"></div></div><div class="tree one"></div><div class="tree two"></div></div><div class="virtual-grid"><div class="card"><h3>️ Front Desk</h3><p class="small">Hear the current hotel announcement.</p><button class="btn primary" onclick="fishlinAnnouncement()">Hear Welcome</button></div><div class="card"><h3>️ Room Surprise</h3><p class="small">Get a random room perk.</p><button class="btn ghost" onclick="roomSurprise()">Try Surprise</button><p id="surprise" class="small"></p></div><div class="card"><h3> Stay Status</h3><p class="small" id="stayStatus">No  reservation yet.</p></div></div></div></section>
<footer><div class="footer-inner"><div><h3> Fishlin Hotel Line</h3><p>Coastal hospitality, comfortable rooms, thoughtful service, and convenient amenities.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="#rooms">Rooms</a><a href="#dining">Dining</a><a href="#activities">Activities</a><a href="#booking">Book</a></div><div><h3>Help</h3><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#assistant">AI Assistant</a><a href="#account">Account</a><a href="#experience">Hotel Experience</a></div></div></footer>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="bookingModal"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-head"><h2>Reservation Created </h2><button class="close" onclick="closeModal('bookingModal')">×</button></div><div id="bookingDetails"></div><div class="cta"><button class="btn primary" onclick="document.getElementById('experience').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});closeModal('bookingModal')">Enter Hotel Experience</button><button class="btn ghost" onclick="closeModal('bookingModal')">Close</button></div></div></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="adminModal"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-head"><h2>Hotel Admin</h2><button class="close" onclick="closeModal('adminModal')">×</button></div><p class="small">Hotel administration panel. Staff access code: <strong>5567</strong></p><div id="adminLocked"><div class="field"><label for="adminCode">Admin code</label><input id="adminCode" type="password" placeholder="5567"></div><button class="btn primary" style="margin-top:12px" onclick="unlockAdmin()">Unlock</button></div><div id="adminTools" style="display:none"><div class="field"><label for="adminAnnouncement">Announcement</label><textarea id="adminAnnouncement" rows="3" placeholder="Welcome to Fishlin Hotel Line!"></textarea></div><div class="account-actions" style="margin-top:12px"><button class="btn primary" onclick="publishAnnouncement()">Publish Announcement</button><button class="btn ghost" onclick="clearAnnouncement()">Clear Announcement</button></div></div></div></div>
<script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),money=n=>'$'+Number(n).toLocaleString('en-US');
function localDateString(d){return `${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`}
const today=new Date();$('checkin').min=localDateString(today);$('checkout').min=localDateString(today);
function nights(){if(!$('checkin').value||!$('checkout').value)return 1;return Math.max(1,Math.round((new Date($('checkout').value)-new Date($('checkin').value))/86400000))}
function calcTotal(){const room=Number($('room').value),n=nights(),adults=Math.max(1,Number($('adults').value)||1),children=Math.max(0,Number($('children').value)||0);let extras=0,lines=[];document.querySelectorAll('.extra:checked').forEach(el=>{const p=Number(el.dataset.price),type=el.dataset.type;let amount=p;if(type==='night')amount=p*n;if(type==='guest')amount=p*(adults+children);extras+=amount;lines.push(`<div class="total-line"><span>${el.dataset.name}</span><strong>${money(amount)}</strong></div>`)});const base=room*n,total=base+extras;$('summary').innerHTML=`<div class="total-line"><span>Room × ${n} night${n===1?'':'s'}</span><strong>${money(base)}</strong></div><div class="total-line"><span>Guests</span><strong>${adults+children}</strong></div>${lines.join('')}`;$('total').textContent=money(total);return{room,n,adults,children,total}}
['room','checkin','checkout','adults','children','special'].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener('input',calcTotal));document.querySelectorAll('.extra').forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('change',calcTotal));
$('checkin').addEventListener('change',()=>{$('checkout').min=$('checkin').value||localDateString(today);if($('checkout').value&&$('checkout').value<=$('checkin').value)$('checkout').value='';calcTotal()});
function roomName(v){return({'180':'Coastal King Room','275':'Deluxe Double Room','325':'Ocean View King','425':'Family Room','650':'Fishlin Suite','725':'Family Connecting Suite','900':'Executive Bay Suite','1500':'Royal Bay Penthouse','2000':'Presidential Bay Residence'})[String(v)]||'Selected Room'}
function chooseRoom(price){$('room').value=String(price);calcTotal();document.getElementById('booking').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});}
function showSuiteTab(id,btn){document.querySelectorAll('.suite-panel').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));document.querySelectorAll('.suite-tab').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));$(id).classList.add('active');btn.classList.add('active')}
function bookStay(){const checkin=$('checkin').value,checkout=$('checkout').value;if(!checkin||!checkout||checkout<=checkin){alert('Please choose a valid check-in and a check-out date after it.');return}const c=calcTotal(),b={room:roomName(c.room),checkin,checkout,nights:c.n,adults:c.adults,children:c.children,total:c.total,special:$('special').value,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()};localStorage.setItem('fishlinBooking',JSON.stringify(b));$('bookingDetails').innerHTML=`<div class="notice"><strong>${b.room}</strong><br>${b.checkin} to ${b.checkout} (${b.nights} night${b.nights===1?'':'s'})<br>Guests: ${b.adults} adults, ${b.children} children<br>Total: <strong>${money(b.total)}</strong></div><p class="small">Your reservation request has been saved locally in this browser.</p>`;$('stayStatus').textContent=`Reserved: ${b.room} | ${b.checkin} to ${b.checkout}`;$('bookingModal').classList.add('show')}
function loadBooking(){try{const b=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fishlinBooking')||'null');if(b)$('stayStatus').textContent=`Reserved: ${b.room} | ${b.checkin} to ${b.checkout}`}catch{}}
function openAdmin(){$('adminModal').classList.add('show')}function unlockAdmin(){if($('adminCode').value==='5567'){$('adminLocked').style.display='none';$('adminTools').style.display='block';$('adminAnnouncement').value=localStorage.getItem('fishlinAnnouncement')||''}else alert('Incorrect  admin code.')}
function publishAnnouncement(){const text=$('adminAnnouncement').value.trim();if(!text)return alert('Enter an announcement first.');localStorage.setItem('fishlinAnnouncement',text);$('announcement').textContent=' '+text;alert('Announcement published.')}
function clearAnnouncement(){localStorage.removeItem('fishlinAnnouncement');$('announcement').textContent=' Welcome to Fishlin Hotel Line — Comfortable stays. Attentive service.';$('adminAnnouncement').value=''}function closeModal(id){$(id).classList.remove('show')}
function fishlinAnnouncement(){const a=localStorage.getItem('fishlinAnnouncement')||'Welcome to Fishlin Hotel Line! We hope you enjoy your stay.';if('speechSynthesis'in window){speechSynthesis.cancel();const u=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(a);u.rate=.95;u.pitch=1.02;speechSynthesis.speak(u)}alert(a)}
function roomSurprise(){const s=['You found a complimentary hot cocoa voucher! ☕','A moonlit balcony seat is ready for you. ','Your  room has a surprise snack basket. ','You unlocked a late-night movie pick. ','The front desk left a tiny welcome star by your door. ⭐'];$('surprise').textContent=s[Math.floor(Math.random()*s.length)]}
function escapeHtml(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]))}
function saveProfile(){const p={name:$('displayName').value.trim()||'Guest',bio:$('bio').value.trim()||'Your hotel profile.',avatar:$('avatarUrl').value.trim(),role:$('hotelRole').value};localStorage.setItem('fishlinProfile',JSON.stringify(p));renderProfile(p);alert('Profile saved locally.')}
function renderProfile(p){$('displayName').value=p.name;$('bio').value=p.bio;$('avatarUrl').value=p.avatar;$('hotelRole').value=p.role;$('profileName').textContent=p.name;$('profileRole').textContent=p.role;$('profileBio').textContent=p.bio;$('avatarPreview').innerHTML=p.avatar?`<img src="${escapeHtml(p.avatar)}" alt="Profile picture">`:escapeHtml(p.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase())}
function loadProfile(){let p={name:'Guest',bio:'Your hotel profile.',avatar:'',role:'Guest'};try{const x=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fishlinProfile')||'null');if(x)p={...p,...x}}catch{}renderProfile(p)}
function demoGoogleSignIn(){alert('Google sign-in requires a Firebase project or another secure authentication backend. This button does not fake a successful login.')}
function botReply(text){const t=text.toLowerCase();if(/\b(thank|thanks|thank you)\b/.test(t)){$('chatInput').disabled=true;$('chatSend').disabled=true;return 'you are very welcome!, thank your for asking me what you need!'}if(t.includes('real'))return'No. Fishlin Hotel Line is .';if(t.includes('family')||t.includes('children'))return'Yes. The  booking form supports adults and children.';if(t.includes('profile')||t.includes('account'))return'Yes. You can change your display name, bio, profile picture, and hotel role any time.';if(t.includes('payment')||t.includes('pay'))return'No. Reservations do not process real payments.';if(t.includes('google')||t.includes('sign in'))return'Real Google sign-in requires Firebase Authentication or another secure authentication backend.';if(t.includes('room')||t.includes('price')||t.includes('cost'))return'Rooms range from $180/night for the Cozy Garden Room to $1,500/night for the Royal Bay Penthouse.';return'I can only answer Fishlin Hotel Line FAQ questions about the hotel, rooms, families, profiles, authentication, and reservations.'}
function askAssistant(){const input=$('chatInput'),text=input.value.trim();if(!text)return;const log=$('chatLog');log.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="msg user">${escapeHtml(text)}</div>`);log.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="msg bot">${escapeHtml(botReply(text))}</div>`);input.value='';log.scrollTop=log.scrollHeight}$('chatInput').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')askAssistant()});
const savedAnnouncement=localStorage.getItem('fishlinAnnouncement');if(savedAnnouncement)$('announcement').textContent=' '+savedAnnouncement;loadProfile();loadBooking();calcTotal();window.addEventListener('click',e=>document.querySelectorAll('.modal-backdrop.show').forEach(m=>{if(e.target===m)m.classList.remove('show')}));
</script>
